      "item_body": "<p>[A]</p><p>A diver jumps from a 3 m springboard. The diver's height above the water, h metres, at time t seconds after jumping is given by h(t) = -4.9t^2 + 9.5t + 2.2.</p><p>a. When is the diver's height increasing and when is it decreasing?</p><p>b. When is the diver's velocity increasing and when is it decreasing?</p>",
